msgctxt "2900"
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "212_Akiyama"
msgid "Hana-chan. Is the money all set?"
msgstr "Hana-chan, ¿tienes el dinero listo?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "224_Hana"
msgid "Yep. Thirty million yen. I put it in a briefcase for you."
msgstr "Como usted ordenó. Treinta millones de yenes. Todo está en un maletín."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "236_Akiyama"
msgid "Thanks. Appreciate you always being on top of things. It\\r\nhelps a lot."
msgstr "Te agradezco que siempre estés al tanto de todo.\nEres de gran ayuda."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "272_Akiyama"
msgid "Apparently, the exchange point is the taxi stand near the\\r\nKamurocho Hills construction site."
msgstr "Al parecer, el punto de encuentro es la parada de taxis cerca del\nsitio de obras de Kamurocho Hills."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "284_Hana"
msgid "Well, it's your money, Chief. I'm not going to tell you how\\r\nto use it..."
msgstr "Es su dinero, jefe. No tengo intención de decirle cómo\nmanejarlo..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "296_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm sorry. I always make you go along with my crazy plans."
msgstr "Perdona. Siempre te meto en mis locuras."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "308_Hana"
msgid "Don't worry about it. I do this job because I want to."
msgstr "No se preocupe. Hago esto por voluntad propia."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=Kcat0
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "320_Hana"
msgid "Just be careful, all right? You have a habit of getting\\r\ncaught up in shady deals."
msgstr "Solo tenga cuidado, ¿sí? Tiene la costumbre de\ninvolucrarse en tratos sospechosos."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "332_Akiyama"
msgid "I know. I will. Now, if you'll excuse me, I've got a date\\r\nover at the lockers."
msgstr "Lo sé. Lo sé. Ahora, si me disculpas, tengo que ir\\r\na los casilleros."

